00:00:00.141 --> 00:00:01.198
- Good morning, Believe Nation.

00:00:01.198 --> 00:00:04.694
Today's message is "Do it for a reason."

00:00:04.694 --> 00:00:07.111
Over to you, Notorious B.I.G.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.462
(rooster crowing)

00:00:12.462 --> 00:00:14.701
♫ I wake up every mornin'

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:19.091
♫ Entspresso keep me goin'

00:00:19.091 --> 00:00:21.491
- Whatever you going to do,
just do it for a reason.

00:00:21.491 --> 00:00:22.549
You know what I'm
sayin'? Don't be the fool

00:00:22.549 --> 00:00:23.382
that just sit back and do it

00:00:23.382 --> 00:00:24.826
'cause somebody else thought it.

00:00:24.826 --> 00:00:26.128
Because only thing you
going to do is follow

00:00:26.128 --> 00:00:27.962
in somebody else's footsteps
and you're just going to be

00:00:27.962 --> 00:00:30.643
a shadow who will be shadow
for the rest of their life.

00:00:30.643 --> 00:00:31.476
You know what I'm sayin'?

00:00:31.476 --> 00:00:34.076
If you got a little somethin'
that you know how to do,

00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:36.494
progress at it, keep
tryin', I mean, God knows

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:37.794
what could happen, you
know what I'm sayin'?

00:00:37.794 --> 00:00:39.176
That's what I did.

00:00:39.176 --> 00:00:40.074
's kept on rappin',

00:00:40.074 --> 00:00:41.741
just happened to get to the right ears.

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:42.574
You know what I'm sayin'?

00:00:42.574 --> 00:00:44.426
- If you look at anybody who's had success

00:00:44.426 --> 00:00:45.442
in whatever field they're in,

00:00:45.442 --> 00:00:46.783
they've done it for a reason.

00:00:46.783 --> 00:00:48.614
It wasn't just try to
make money, it wasn't

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:50.402
just tryin' to beat somebody else,

00:00:50.402 --> 00:00:51.789
it wasn't just tryin'
to make their parents

00:00:51.789 --> 00:00:53.698
or their friends or somebody else happy,

00:00:53.698 --> 00:00:56.341
and that, that's the worst reason.

00:00:56.341 --> 00:00:57.198
If you're doing something, just to try

00:00:57.198 --> 00:00:58.745
to make your parents happy, or friends,

00:00:58.745 --> 00:01:01.428
or somebody else's expectations,
it never works out.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:03.119
You never hit it big.

00:01:03.119 --> 00:01:05.637
You're always playing small
because it's not your dream.

00:01:05.637 --> 00:01:06.650
It's not your goal.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:09.537
You'll have some success, but
you'll have small success here

00:01:09.537 --> 00:01:12.263
where you really should be
killing it way over here.

00:01:12.263 --> 00:01:14.095
You have to have a powerful reason.

00:01:14.095 --> 00:01:17.316
And this is what separates
you from everybody else.

00:01:17.316 --> 00:01:20.320
Because your reason is
as unique as you are.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:24.265
Why you want to do something
is customized to yourself.

00:01:24.265 --> 00:01:26.862
And that's where you're going
to have the most success,

00:01:26.862 --> 00:01:29.138
by following the thing
that gets you excited,

00:01:29.138 --> 00:01:31.738
by following the thing
that applies your reason

00:01:31.738 --> 00:01:33.652
to your business, your career path,

00:01:33.652 --> 00:01:35.236
wherever you end up going.

00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:37.721
I love entrepreneurs. I
believe in entrepreneurs.

00:01:37.721 --> 00:01:41.218
I'm doing it in my way.
I'm creating and expressing

00:01:41.218 --> 00:01:43.741
how Evan Carmichael creates and expresses.

00:01:43.741 --> 00:01:47.198
And as long as I am true to
myself, nobody will beat me,

00:01:47.198 --> 00:01:49.027
because you can't out-Evan Evan.

00:01:49.027 --> 00:01:51.223
And I can't out-you you.

00:01:51.223 --> 00:01:53.421
So you got to find you,
because that's how you win.

00:01:53.421 --> 00:01:54.882
If I look at you and I
can't tell the difference

00:01:54.882 --> 00:01:57.117
between everybody else,
and all you're doin'

00:01:57.117 --> 00:02:00.292
is following the best practices
and not modelling them,

00:02:00.292 --> 00:02:02.003
and not applying them and twisting them

00:02:02.003 --> 00:02:03.547
to make it work for you,

00:02:03.547 --> 00:02:06.351
and creating something
that hasn't existed before,

00:02:06.351 --> 00:02:08.426
then you're always going to be a shell.

00:02:08.426 --> 00:02:10.377
You're always going to
have minor wins instead of

00:02:10.377 --> 00:02:13.350
big, huge, empire-like victories.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.222
And so I think that's really
important for any entrepreneur,

00:02:15.222 --> 00:02:17.379
for anybody, really,
but for entrepreneurs,

00:02:17.379 --> 00:02:19.246
to find your reason.

00:02:19.246 --> 00:02:21.359
To understand why you're doing this.

00:02:21.359 --> 00:02:23.471
To ask yourself, looking
yourself in the mirror

00:02:23.471 --> 00:02:24.776
and why am I doing this?

00:02:24.776 --> 00:02:26.243
And you better have a really good reason,

00:02:26.243 --> 00:02:29.285
and if you don't, if you don't
have a really good reason,

00:02:29.285 --> 00:02:31.032
for why you're doing
the thing you're doing,

00:02:31.032 --> 00:02:34.665
that's why you're not having any success.

00:02:34.665 --> 00:02:35.599
Alright?

00:02:35.599 --> 00:02:36.864
If you're not further ahead, if you're not

00:02:36.864 --> 00:02:39.057
where you want to be,
if you're not crushing

00:02:39.057 --> 00:02:42.350
on your goals, I'd
really examine your why.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.705
And ask yourself, do I
have a really strong reason

00:02:44.705 --> 00:02:46.940
to keep doing this?

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.742
Because if you don't, you're
never going to hit it big.

00:02:49.742 --> 00:02:51.779
So the question of the
day today is, I'm curious,

00:02:51.779 --> 00:02:55.925
what is your reason for
why you do what you do?

00:02:55.925 --> 00:02:57.503
What is your big reason?

00:02:57.503 --> 00:02:58.886
Leave it in the comments below.

